@startuml Component Diagram - FreeRTOS Application
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

title Component Diagram (Part 1) - FreeRTOS Application Module

package "Entry Point" {
    [main.cpp] as main
}

package "FreeRTOS Application Module" {
    [freertos_app.h/cpp] as fapp
    [init.h/cpp] as init
    [tasks.h/cpp] as tasks
    [sync.h/cpp] as sync
    [state.h/cpp] as state
}

main --> fapp : setup() / loop()
fapp --> init : setupApplication()
init --> state : read/write globals
init --> sync : initSyncPrimitives()
init --> tasks : createApplicationTasks()
tasks --> state : access SharedData
tasks --> sync : updateLCD()

note bottom of state
  Contains:
  - SharedData struct
  - Global pointers (LEDs, LCD, Joystick)
  - Pin definitions
  - Sync primitives (Mutex, Semaphores)
end note

@enduml
